{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_main_08-04_end",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "main_08-04",
  "title": "火种，一触即灭",
  "storyCode": "R8-4",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "442b1bdda9f656be1f45753bf36416ae31d0cc67c90c5892952107d73a9a4e03",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snow_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以呢，你打跑了他们，是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没跟你去是对的。用火去烧人......这种味道，我要是再闻到，一定会吐出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿丽娜，别勉强自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前是我自己要跟着你走的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我也会保护你们这些感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我不是在求你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那当然不是。阿丽娜，没有你我就没时间去搜集资源和信息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和你通信的人是谁，方便告诉我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怀疑我是乌萨斯的间谍吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是在想把你卷进这些事好不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在身为感染者的时候，我们的生活就没法更坏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去联系的是其他城市的感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在尝试从他们那里更快地了解城市的动向，好尽可能地帮上在冻原上生存的感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在做一件......很了不得的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这么强的正义感是从哪来的？是因为以前有人这么教过你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我受到的教育，既恶毒又疯癫，充满了统治的傲慢和权力的恐怖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我决定反着走。我要剥掉他们彬彬有礼的皮囊，拆开他们引以为豪的一层接一层的贵族城市，把真相告诉所有人，雪原上的所有人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后我们决定自己的命运。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们去开垦这片大地。我们建立自己的家园，谁不让我们这么做，我们就推翻他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这片大地本就有一部分是属于感染者的......就像这片大地的许多地方，本来就属于所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......现实点，塔露拉。这有点太遥远了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔露拉，你这样做，这个村子就彻底毁了。他们将无处可归，纠察队会一直跟在他们身后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不这么做，那个村子也会逐渐荒废。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是所有人都能成为战士。老人、孩子、伤病的人，让他们放弃自己赖以生存的，哪怕是贫瘠的土地，他们也是活不下去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，阿丽娜。所以我们要去找新的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来，跟我走，阿丽娜。今晚我们有地方可住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_iceforest_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢你招待我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪有，没有你们，我们可能已经都死了。虽然现在也和死了没差多少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很抱歉，一开始对你那样，我还准备打你。都怪我，不争气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能用来招待你们的东西也没剩下什么，凑合吃吧，一点麦粥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常感谢你，先生，其实没必要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，没什么，反正只剩这点了。接下来就过几天是几天，没什么差别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想建一个村子，哪怕是这么远......也没用的，都没什么用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们逃不过。乌萨斯这么大，往哪里走都没用，到处都是纠察官......其他人也不会接纳你。我们无处可去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，跟我走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......去哪？现在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用是现在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等你们想清楚了，或者真的被逼得无路可去，如果还想活下去，就来找我，或者找我的兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去荒野上的话，冻原的生活......真的很糟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我们有地方可去，我们有未开化的土地，我们去找能耕种能收割的地方；我们还有很多人，他们会帮各个村庄做买卖，也能有收入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们总能活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那要是纠察队又来了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我们战胜他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你刚说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能做到，你们也能。你刚才拿起武器对着我，是对的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一旦有人去掠夺我们，我们就团结起来打退他们。感染者是有力的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们感染者会一点点重拾自己的生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "面包，以及火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
